#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2250 expect=noViolation domain=SJ
#note "The unplanned stage (row 1) leaves RSTAGE empty and describes itself in SJUPDES instead; the planned gestation stage (row 2) carries RSTAGE, which is outside this rule's condition."
#library standard=sendig version=dart-1-1
dataset SJ label="Subject Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SJSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
col SJUPDES type=Char label="Description of Unplanned Repro Stage"
---
S1 | 001 | 1 | UNPLAN |           | Unplanned recovery period
S1 | 001 | 2 | GEST   | Gestation |
